2. In this Order, “specified company” refers to any of the following:
(a)Asia‑Europe Foundation (UEN 199700781D);
(b)Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation Limited (UEN 200600593Z).

3. A specified company is exempt from all of the following provisions of the Act:
(a)section 386AF(1), (2), (3), (7), (8), (9) and (11);
(b)section 386AFA(3), (4), (5) and (6);
(c)section 386AG(1) and (2);
(d)section 386AH(1);
(e)section 386AKA(1), (3), (4) and (5);
(f)section 386AN(3);
[S 349/2025 wef 16/06/2025]
(g)section 386ANA(2) and (3).
[S 349/2025 wef 16/06/2025]

4. A person who is a registrable controller of a specified company is exempt from all of the following provisions of the Act:
(a)section 386AF(10);
(b)section 386AJ;
(c)section 386AK.
